          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Q: How do I give this to my dog?</strong><br/>A: Add a few drops to their food or water bowl. The serum has a soft taste, so even the fussiest eaters will have no problem with it.<br/><br/><strong>Q: How long until I start seeing results?</strong><br/>A: Most owners report visible improvement in mobility within 2-4 weeks. Joint support is cumulative, so <strong>results continue to build over time.</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Consistency</span> is key for better aging!<br/><br/><strong>Q: What if my dog doesn’t like the taste?</strong><br/>A: Dogs will generally not be bothered by the soft taste of the serum. But in the rare case that this happens, we’ll issue you a full refund!<br/><br/><strong>Q:</strong> <strong>Is this suitable for all breeds and ages?<br/></strong>Yes. The formula is vegan, hypoallergenic, and safe for dogs of all breeds and ages. If your dog is on medication, we recommend checking with your vet first.</p><p></p>",
            "page": "",
            "collapsible_tab_style": "default",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        }
