            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>\"Saw this brand on instagram, didn't expect much, but it has worked wonders for my lab's flexibility. She's moving like she's a pup again! Happy customer ☺️\"</p>",
            "author": "<p><strong>- Charli</strong></p>"
