            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 5,
            "text": "<p>\"These chews have been a game-changer for my dog. Her itching has reduced dramatically, and her coat is healthy now. Plus, I've noticed fewer digestive issues. LOVE the bag! ❤️\"</p>",
            "author": "<p><strong>- Jennifer</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_6Jm6xn": {
